                        <td width ="90%" valign="top"><a name="newsitemEpAlpuVVpyZrTLvNrv"></a></a></font></style><img src="EQ.gif">  <FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><b>Welcome Officer Advocate Talferian</b></font></font><hr align="left" width="97%"><font face="Verdana, Arial" size="1" color="#999999">Posted by <a href="mailto:aalain@sok.org"<b>Aalain</b></a> on Sunday, October 17 2004</font><FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><br><br>I wanted to personally welcome Talferian to being an officer advocate in EQ. Talf has come a long way the past months in assisting guild members and officers in EQ. <A HREF="http://www.sok.org/board/viewtopic.php?t=24108">Please help welcome him here...</A></font></font><br><br><br>

<a name="newsitemEpAlpuVFuAicMnaXoT"></a></a></font></style><img src="EQ.gif">  <FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><b>Welcome Officer Advocate Lini </b></font></font><hr align="left" width="97%"><font face="Verdana, Arial" size="1" color="#999999">Posted by <a href="mailto:aalain@sok.org"<b>Aalain</b></a> on Sunday, October 17 2004</font><FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><br><br>I would like to personally welcome Lini to being an Officer Advocate in Everquest. Lini has been raid leading for the guild for what feels like eons, and I'm sure this new workload will be met with the same vigor. <A HREF="http://www.sok.org/board/viewtopic.php?t=24107">You can welcome her here...</A> </font></font><br><br><br>

<a name="newsitemEpAZuZyZFZWCNzhlDQ"></a></a></font></style><img src="(default).gif">  <FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><b>Welcome Our Newest Knight, Hannar Stormwolf</b></font></font><hr align="left" width="97%"><font face="Verdana, Arial" size="1" color="#999999">Posted by <a href="mailto:erolotis@sok.org"<b>Erolotis</b></a> on Monday, October 11 2004</font><FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><br><br>Welcome back to SOK Hannar!</font></font><br><br><br>

<a name="newsitemEpAZkAuEZZssYzBBOL"></a></a></font></style><img src="(default).gif">  <FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><b>Welcome Officer Advocate Sabelle!</b></font></font><hr align="left" width="97%"><font face="Verdana, Arial" size="1" color="#999999">Posted by <a href="mailto:"<b>Trubador</b></a> on Friday, October 8 2004</font><FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><br><br></a>Sabelle has been an incredible help as the guild in CoH moved from infancy to official branch.  Now she has agreed to continue to build a home for the knights in CoH as an Officer Advocate... <font size=-3>(poor soul)</font>. <A href="http://www.sok.org/board/viewtopic.php?t=23900">Please join me in offering her condolences..</A> </font></font><br><br><br>

<a name="newsitemEpAyAFkVupZmGuRKgf"></a></a></font></style><img src="(default).gif">  <FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><b>Welcome Officer Moreta!</b></font></font><hr align="left" width="97%"><font face="Verdana, Arial" size="1" color="#999999">Posted by <a href="mailto:jubal@sok.org"<b>Jubal</b></a> on Monday, October 4 2004</font><FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><br><br></a>Moreta has worked hard for the guild as an Officer Advocate maintaining our Dark Age of Camelot branch and it is time for her to step up to the plate as an Officer. <A href="http://www.sok.org/board/viewtopic.php?p=255110#255110">Please join me in offering condolences</A> <IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://www.sok.org/board/images/smiles/icon_wink.gif" align=baseline border=0></font></font><br><br><br>

<a name="newsitemEpAyAFkuluxQcQswKi"></a></a></font></style><img src="(default).gif">  <FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><b>Welcome Officer Aalain!</b></font></font><hr align="left" width="97%"><font face="Verdana, Arial" size="1" color="#999999">Posted by <a href="mailto:jubal@sok.org"<b>Jubal</b></a> on Monday, October 4 2004</font><FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><br><br></a><X-WYSIWYGv1.0>Aalain has worked hard for the guild as an Officer Advocate assisting Leod in EverQuest&nbsp;and&nbsp;maintaining sok.org and all that that entails.&nbsp;and it is time for him to step up to the plate as an Officer. Please <A href="http://www.sok.org/board/viewtopic.php?p=255109#255109">join me in offering condolences</A> <IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://www.sok.org/board/images/smiles/icon_wink.gif" align=baseline border=0></font></font><br><br><br>

