<a name="newsitemEpAulAEAuFgIUSCYsY"></a></a></font></style><img src="(default).gif">  <FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><b>City of Heroes Branch made Official!</b></font></font><hr align="left" width="97%"><font face="Verdana, Arial" size="1" color="#999999">Posted by <a href="mailto:"<b>Trubador</b></a> on Saturday, September 11 2004</font><FONT face="Verdana, Arial" size="2"><br><br><X-WYSIWYGv1.0><P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt">At approximately <st1:time Hour="0" Minute="0"><st1:time Hour="0" Minute="0">midnight</st1:time></st1:time> last night at the <A href="http://www.sok.org/board/viewtopic.php?t=23169">SOK Block Party</A>, the CoH Branch of SOK went official. It was a phenomenal time with spandex and leather costumes, dancing and the knighting of two friends of the guild Cinnerse and Kara. We then wiped out packs of evil doers scorched earth style... Avengers?&nbsp; X-Men?&nbsp; Pansies!&nbsp; You want to strike fear in the heart of a villain?&nbsp; Nothing beats a mad pack of Knights.</P><P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt">&nbsp;</P><P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt">Congratulate them <A href="http://www.sok.org/board/viewtopic.php?t=23312">HERE</A>!</P></font></font><br><br><br>

